# Applies to builds whose context is the repository root (e.g. the API image,
# which bundles the corresponding source — see api/Dockerfile).
# Keeps the build context small and keeps build artifacts / dependencies out of
# the generated source bundle (recipients restore these with mvn / npm install).
.git
.github
.idea
**/node_modules
api/target
**/build
**/dist
**/.gradle
*.iml
api/src/main/resources/static/source
.env
atlas_backups
DEVELOPMENT-STATUS.md
